1
00:00:05,650 --> 00:00:09,439
I knew their footsteps by the sound of their breathing.
听着他们的呼吸，我就知道他们又迈出了一步。

2
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:20,550
Though my soul may set in darkness,
纵使我的灵魂沉入黑暗，

3
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,935
it will rise in perfect light.
它终将在澄澈的光中升起。

4
00:00:28,700 --> 00:00:31,593
I have loved the stars too truly
我如此真切地爱过繁星，

5
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:37,007
to be fearful of the night.
又怎会畏惧黑夜。

6
00:00:40,100 --> 00:00:42,246
Someone stood here once.
曾经，有人站在这里。

7
00:00:47,250 --> 00:00:48,798
Ready? Let go.
准备好了？松手。

8
00:01:00,650 --> 00:01:04,183
Alone up here, I kept one eye on the needles.
独自留在舱里，我的目光总回到那些指针上。

9
00:01:09,200 --> 00:01:12,093
Columbia, this is Eagle. We have you in sight.
哥伦比亚号，这里是鹰号。我们看见你了。

10
00:01:19,250 --> 00:01:20,585
Hard dock.
对接锁定。

11
00:01:21,050 --> 00:01:23,260
Welcome back aboard.
欢迎归舱。
